    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truck World: Australia \u2013 First Haul</strong> is your first mission as a truck driver in the red heart of Australia. Hit the road through the continent\u2019s vast deserts \u2013 miles of road, scorching heat and a face-to-face encounter with a real sandstorm await. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1ffeb77a4a30c7273ff4e065f9f3444a.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1ffeb77a4a30c7273ff4e065f9f3444a.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1ffeb77a4a30c7273ff4e065f9f3444a.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Sandstorm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a roaring wall of dust that rocks your rig and cuts sight to almost nothing \u2013 just a glimpse of the dynamic weather system that brings storms, fog, rain and more to every journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/b77663ddbb6e97e6b13ce6522b3d89cc.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/b77663ddbb6e97e6b13ce6522b3d89cc.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/b77663ddbb6e97e6b13ce6522b3d89cc.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom Beyond the Cab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of your truck to manually secure the load, lower and raise the trailer legs, and connect or disconnect the hitch. Take full control over every stage of your delivery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/25b73278eb07327eda892546579d7a06.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/25b73278eb07327eda892546579d7a06.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/25b73278eb07327eda892546579d7a06.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outback Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Australia\u2019s stunning red wilderness. Swap smooth highways for rugged dirt tracks and muddy backroads that can trap your wheels. Deliver vital cargo and help solve real-world challenges \u2013 not just for yourself but for the entire Outback community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1e908032d9c90a16fdd019867c42bd53.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1e908032d9c90a16fdd019867c42bd53.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1e908032d9c90a16fdd019867c42bd53.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Physics and Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every bump, every turn and every blast of wind. Witness breathtaking sunrises and sunsets behind the wheel of a multi-tonne truck, fully immersed in a new generation of trucking realism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/fa0c3657e03cd1b8525c1a1c2c221ed5.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/fa0c3657e03cd1b8525c1a1c2c221ed5.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/fa0c3657e03cd1b8525c1a1c2c221ed5.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Haul Is Just the Beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively developing and expanding the game \u2013 and your feedback plays a vital role. Share your thoughts \u2013 we\u2019re listening and building a better journey together!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Truck World: Australia \u2013 First Haul</strong> is your first mission as a truck driver in the red heart of Australia. Hit the road through the continent\u2019s vast deserts \u2013 miles of road, scorching heat and a face-to-face encounter with a real sandstorm await. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1ffeb77a4a30c7273ff4e065f9f3444a.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1ffeb77a4a30c7273ff4e065f9f3444a.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1ffeb77a4a30c7273ff4e065f9f3444a.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer the Sandstorm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a roaring wall of dust that rocks your rig and cuts sight to almost nothing \u2013 just a glimpse of the dynamic weather system that brings storms, fog, rain and more to every journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/b77663ddbb6e97e6b13ce6522b3d89cc.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/b77663ddbb6e97e6b13ce6522b3d89cc.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/b77663ddbb6e97e6b13ce6522b3d89cc.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freedom Beyond the Cab</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step out of your truck to manually secure the load, lower and raise the trailer legs, and connect or disconnect the hitch. Take full control over every stage of your delivery. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/25b73278eb07327eda892546579d7a06.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/25b73278eb07327eda892546579d7a06.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/25b73278eb07327eda892546579d7a06.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outback Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Australia\u2019s stunning red wilderness. Swap smooth highways for rugged dirt tracks and muddy backroads that can trap your wheels. Deliver vital cargo and help solve real-world challenges \u2013 not just for yourself but for the entire Outback community.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1e908032d9c90a16fdd019867c42bd53.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1e908032d9c90a16fdd019867c42bd53.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/1e908032d9c90a16fdd019867c42bd53.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Next-Gen Physics and Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel every bump, every turn and every blast of wind. Witness breathtaking sunrises and sunsets behind the wheel of a multi-tonne truck, fully immersed in a new generation of trucking realism. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/fa0c3657e03cd1b8525c1a1c2c221ed5.poster.avif?t=1753783187\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/fa0c3657e03cd1b8525c1a1c2c221ed5.webm?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694620/extras/fa0c3657e03cd1b8525c1a1c2c221ed5.mp4?t=1753783187\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First Haul Is Just the Beginning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re actively developing and expanding the game \u2013 and your feedback plays a vital role. Share your thoughts \u2013 we\u2019re listening and building a better journey together!</p>",
